    "short_description": "Conquer a vast procedurally generated star system in Falling Frontier, a sci-fi RTS where intel and logistics are decisive factors. Design ships and raid enemy supply lines, lay minefields and construct recon stations, and ambush enemy forces within asteroid fields and nebulae.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Czech, Hungarian, Ukrainian",
    "reviews": "\u201cSpaceship RTS Falling Frontier looks like The Expanse in a very good way.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cFalling Frontier takes the traditions of strategy and RTS games but adds various new layers of tension and drama... The universe is vast and procedurally generated, and you can build spaceports, refineries, supply depots, and recon stations to help expand your influence and keep your enemy at bay.\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br><br>\u201cThere\u2019s a little dose of Warhammer 40,000 in there for sure, and I love it.\u201d<br>Sports Illustrated<br>",
